00:09:32.920 SET-FIELD PROBE IS ON - which by now means 'the channel answers at all'. The
00:09:32.920   flag is a misnomer kept for the launch line: without it Session::handle
00:09:32.920   returns nothing for every packet, so the migration hello goes unanswered and
